# The specialized one-quantifier transfer

Gismatullin's transfer: a Boolean combination of closure-membership conditions
with finite parameters from `K₁` has a witness in `K₁` iff it has one in `K₂`,
under the transcendence-degree hypothesis (9.4)
(blueprint Thm one-quantifier-transfer).

**Status:** skeleton (M0); contents arrive with M5 (checklist T3).

This module is part of the formalization of the Evans–Hrushovski–Gismatullin
reconstruction theorem; the source of truth is `sources/blueprint.tex`.
